    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An erotic adventure with jrpg style combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870580/extras/5a754cde3d741ed5707cc7215918cb4b.avif?t=1755100150\" data-has-big width=800 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a devastating cataclysm, the world has descended into savagery and decay. Among the ruins of ancient civilizations, barbarian Nocan searches for gold, glory, and willing women. But during his exploration of another ruin, he accidentally unleashes two lustful demon twins upon the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870580/extras/f9b2ec95ebb05d0c65f96ff41a6b4356.avif?t=1755100150\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now these demons begin gathering an army of followers to enslave the region in a reign of dark power. Nocan, proud and free-spirited, sets out to correct his mistake. To do so, he must collect the fragments of a powerful artifact and face the twins in a final battle against evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870580/extras/46edb0e8ac7b8c5eafc20629645aea1d.avif?t=1755100150\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From tense conversations to tough decisions \u2014 the tavern holds more than just ale and gossip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870580/extras/fd9186287af9be2de64cf8640b5c86de.avif?t=1755100150\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Core Mechanics:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue system presented through dedicated UI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based JRPG-style combat with stamina and skill management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons with battle, loot, NPC, and empty rooms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tavern - Hub: Leveling skills, buying courtesans, mini-game, and interacting with NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870580/extras/7f9f0a83d6dce70afe44381f2892c09e.avif?t=1755100150\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adult scenes with courtesans and rescued girls.</p>",
